sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor Client as Banking.Live client
  participant GW as API Gateway
  participant IAM as Auth0 + IMS
  participant WH as Webhook Platform
  participant P as BL2/Lume producer
  participant S as Sanitizer/event boundary
  participant E as Event transport
  participant EP as Client endpoint
  participant O as Observability

  Client->>GW: Create/update subscription
  GW->>IAM: Validate token and client/region grant
  IAM-->>GW: Allow or deny
  alt authorized
    GW->>WH: Store subscription
    WH-->>GW: Subscription status
    GW-->>Client: Success
  else unauthorized
    GW-->>Client: Deny and audit
  end

  P->>S: Eligible status change
  S->>S: Allow-list and remove CHD data
  S->>E: Publish event_id + approved reference data
  E->>WH: Consume event
  WH->>EP: Signed HTTPS webhook
  alt transient endpoint failure
    WH->>WH: Bounded retry with jitter
    WH-->>EP: Retry or dead-letter
  else accepted
    EP-->>WH: 2xx response
  end
  WH->>O: Redacted delivery outcome, lag, trace
